        ],
        "claim": "Curiosity-era material from 2022 highlights new clues to Mars\u2019 watery past, reflecting continued refinement of the water narrative.",
        "era": 2022
      }
    ],
    "caveats": "The clips are archival media items and many era labels come from the items' video/scene/published metadata rather than primary scientific papers; the footage and short descriptions do not by themselves establish quantitative amounts, precise timings, or detailed mineralogical evidence for water on Mars, and some dates listed are derived from 'video' or 'published' tags in the archive."
